          "parsed": {
            "units": [
              {
                "text": "续期许可证的费用取决于许可证类型，具体金额会在邮寄给您的续期申请上或在线支付前显示。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "How to renew a license#1_0::c0005"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states the renewal fee is on the renewal application mailed and displayed before online payment, and fees vary by license type."
              },
              {
                "text": "费用包括照片文件费和（如适用）大都会通勤交通区（MCTD）附加费。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "How to renew a license#1_0::c0005"
                ],
                "reason": "The context says fees include photo document fee and supplemental MCTD fee if required."
              },
              {
                "text": "增强版驾驶执照（EDL）需额外支付30美元，而REAL ID没有额外费用。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "How to renew a license#1_0::c0005"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states EDL additional fee is $30 and no additional fee for REAL ID."
              },
              {
                "text": "如果您的许可证包含Class M或MJ（例如DM），需额外支付8美元。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "How to renew a license#1_0::c0005"
                ],
                "reason": "The context says if any other class combined with Class M or MJ, add $8."
              },
              {
                "text": "您可以通过邮件、DMV办公室或在线支付，接受的支付方式包括信用卡/借记卡（American Express、Discover、MasterCard、Visa等）或支票/汇票（仅限邮件或办公室）。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "How to renew a license#1_0::c0005"
                ],
                "reason": "The context lists payment methods for mail, office, and online, including credit/debit cards and checks/money orders for mail/office."
              }
            ]
